WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.889
On the Welcome screen, go to Sync a folder
too and choose a source.

2
00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:11.111
Choose A folder on this computer, then
Continue.

3
00:00:11.681 --> 00:00:17.293
Choose Browse, select the folder that
holds your pictures, and click Open.

4
00:00:17.863 --> 00:00:21.562
Scry Sync checks the folder and shows what
it found.

5
00:00:22.132 --> 00:00:25.045
Nothing is sent until you press Start.
